@startuml c1-activity
' DOC-9. C1, the compiler: from the text of a workflow to a plan, or to diagnostics.
' Card: docs/algorithms/C1.md#what-is-ours-the-transformation-and-the-code-we-write
' Card: docs/algorithms/C1.md#adaptation-where-the-plain-textbook-version-is-wrong
' code: flowstat.compiler.compile:compile_workflow
' code: flowstat.dsl.reader:read_yaml
' code: flowstat.dsl.shape:check_shape
' code: flowstat.compiler.workflow:build_workflow
' code: flowstat.compiler.graph:strongly_connected_components
' code: flowstat.compiler.graph:shortest_cycle
' code: flowstat.compiler.graph:topological_order
' code: flowstat.compiler.graph:ancestor_bitsets
skinparam shadowing false

start
:read_yaml: the text to a tree with positions;
if (syntax errors?) then (yes)
  :diagnostics only;
  stop
endif
:check_shape: table-driven, did-you-mean for a key;
if (shape errors?) then (yes)
  :diagnostics only;
  stop
endif
:build_workflow: the typed view of the document;
:phase 1, expand: foreach over a list of the catalogue,\none instance per item, with a source map;
:phase 2, resolve: needs and ${...} to instances\n(load[region], check[*]);
:phase 3, strongly_connected_components\n(explicit stack, no recursion);
if (a component with a cycle?) then (yes)
  :shortest_cycle: a breadth-first search from every node\nof the component, the shortest is reported;
  :diagnostics only;
  stop
endif
:topological_order: the order of the plan;
:ancestor_bitsets: every step read from\nis guaranteed to run before the reader;
:phase 4: types of the expressions and arguments\n(analysis/types.py, check_types);
if (any error?) then (yes)
  :diagnostics (warnings stay with the plan);
else (no)
  :the plan, with its warnings;
endif
stop
@enduml
